  "problem": "A robot starts at the bottom of a staircase with $n$ steps, where $n$ is an integer chosen uniformly at random from $1$ to $10.$ The robot then climbs a uniformly random number of steps between $1$ and $n.$\n\nWhat is the expected number of steps the robot climbs?\n\nThe expected number of steps the robot climbs is\n{{field-1}}.",
